!! 观察者模式在咏唱中的作用

观察者模式用于订阅咏唱事件窗口，获取技能状态反馈和环境变化。事件key只能在订阅回调中获得，无法通过直接调用来获取。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantEventRuntime {
  on<T extends ChantEventKey>(
    event: ChantEventTopic,
    handler: (key: T) => void,
  ): Subscription;
}

type ChantEventTopic =
  | 'meterPulse'
  | 'areaShift'
  | 'projectileCollision'
  | 'targetHit'
  | 'areaDamage'
  | 'projectileMovement'
  | 'enemyInterference'
  | 'artifactResonance'
  | 'chantWindowOpen';
```

!! 技能状态反馈

技能释放后的状态反馈通过咏唱事件窗口传递。平台在技能系统内部触发事件：

```ts
class ProjectileSkillSystem {
  constructor(private events: ChantEventRuntime) {}

  onCollision(projectileId: string, targetId: string): void {
    const key = EventKey.generate({
      projectileId,
      targetId,
      timestamp: Date.now(),
    });
    this.events.emit('projectileCollision', key);
  }
}
```

玩家订阅这些事件来获取技能状态：

```ts
class ProjectileCollisionObserver {
  private collisionKey?: CollisionEventKey;
  private subscription?: Subscription;

  attach(events: ChantEventRuntime): void {
    this.subscription = events.on('projectileCollision', key => {
      this.collisionKey = key;
    });
  }

  async produce(): Promise<ObserverSeal> {
    if (!this.collisionKey) {
      throw new MissingEventKeyError('projectileCollision');
    }

    return observerRuntime.fromEventKey({
      key: this.collisionKey,
      topic: 'projectileCollision',
    });
  }
}
```

!! 环境状态事件

```ts
class AreaShiftObserver {
  private shiftKey?: AreaShiftKey;

  attach(events: ChantEventRuntime): void {
    events.on('areaShift', key => {
      this.shiftKey = key;
    });
  }

  async produce(): Promise<ObserverSeal> {
    if (!this.shiftKey) throw new MissingEventKeyError('areaShift');
    return observerRuntime.fromEventKey({
      key: this.shiftKey,
      topic: 'areaShift',
    });
  }
}
```

!! 组合使用

碰撞检测后触发爆炸效果的咏唱：

```ts
const collisionObserver = new ProjectileCollisionObserver();
collisionObserver.attach(context.events);

const areaObserver = new AreaShiftObserver();
areaObserver.attach(context.events);

const collisionSeal = await collisionObserver.produce();
const areaSeal = await areaObserver.produce();

const pipeline = context.pipelines
  .start(new DetectCollisionStep())
  .then(new CalculateBlastRadiusStep())
  .then(new ApplyAreaDamageStep());

const result = await pipeline.run({
  collision: collisionSeal,
  area: areaSeal,
});
```

!! 反投机

事件key绑定窗口和时间戳，旧key无法复用。平台验证`windowId`和`timestamp`，复制旧签名无效。

